WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.015 --> 00:00:02.517
partbank parts as samples

2
00:00:02.517 --> 00:00:13.873
Type @DNA; on a reagent line

3
00:00:13.873 --> 00:00:16.706
Pick Search partbank at the bottom

4
00:00:16.706 --> 00:00:21.390
It searches your own items and those shared with your groups

5
00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:25.058
It is registered as a sample and referenced in the note

6
00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:31.223
In the Samples view, right-click → Show sample definition

7
00:00:31.223 --> 00:00:38.709
The window shows its partbank link
